{"4589160":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Aptamirror","steam_appid":4589160,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/3e0f2ba48948809ddc46c5952f9b65ec.poster.avif?t=1793714733\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/3e0f2ba48948809ddc46c5952f9b65ec.webm?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/3e0f2ba48948809ddc46c5952f9b65ec.mp4?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aptamirror is a meditative puzzle game where you fold RNA strands to match target structures. Manipulate nucleotides with precision, watch the ghost target illuminate as you get closer to the solution, and experience the quiet satisfaction of a perfect fold.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/87aa32d78b5972309e41782c58c2c68d.poster.avif?t=1793714733\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/87aa32d78b5972309e41782c58c2c68d.webm?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/87aa32d78b5972309e41782c58c2c68d.mp4?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab, Mutate, Cleave, Ligate. Four tools. Dozens of combinations. Early puzzles teach each mechanic in isolation. Later puzzles demand fluent mastery — when to cut a strand, when to mutate a base, when to join two halves into one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/fb91a35c09e13bcacec4bf0df0191cf2.poster.avif?t=1793714733\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/fb91a35c09e13bcacec4bf0df0191cf2.webm?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/fb91a35c09e13bcacec4bf0df0191cf2.mp4?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aptamirror doesn't punish you. Every puzzle waits as long as you need. Experiment freely. Reset any time. The only pressure is the one you put on yourself — chasing a cleaner solution, fewer moves, a perfect three-star fold. No microtransactions. Earn stars to unlock backbone and cursor colors.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed by a PhD Biochemist. Rooted in real science. But you don't need to know a thing about RNA to play.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/a5a16cbba78d6d4e65ec80e37a9c55a3.poster.avif?t=1793714733\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/a5a16cbba78d6d4e65ec80e37a9c55a3.webm?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/a5a16cbba78d6d4e65ec80e37a9c55a3.mp4?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 levels. 10 chapters. Journey from folding your first hairpin to multi-strand gauntlets that fold your brain. Master every level to achieve the prismatic endgame.  <\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/3e0f2ba48948809ddc46c5952f9b65ec.poster.avif?t=1793714733\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/3e0f2ba48948809ddc46c5952f9b65ec.webm?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/3e0f2ba48948809ddc46c5952f9b65ec.mp4?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aptamirror is a meditative puzzle game where you fold RNA strands to match target structures. Manipulate nucleotides with precision, watch the ghost target illuminate as you get closer to the solution, and experience the quiet satisfaction of a perfect fold.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/87aa32d78b5972309e41782c58c2c68d.poster.avif?t=1793714733\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/87aa32d78b5972309e41782c58c2c68d.webm?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/87aa32d78b5972309e41782c58c2c68d.mp4?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab, Mutate, Cleave, Ligate. Four tools. Dozens of combinations. Early puzzles teach each mechanic in isolation. Later puzzles demand fluent mastery — when to cut a strand, when to mutate a base, when to join two halves into one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/fb91a35c09e13bcacec4bf0df0191cf2.poster.avif?t=1793714733\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/fb91a35c09e13bcacec4bf0df0191cf2.webm?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/fb91a35c09e13bcacec4bf0df0191cf2.mp4?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aptamirror doesn't punish you. Every puzzle waits as long as you need. Experiment freely. Reset any time. The only pressure is the one you put on yourself — chasing a cleaner solution, fewer moves, a perfect three-star fold. No microtransactions. Earn stars to unlock backbone and cursor colors.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed by a PhD Biochemist. Rooted in real science. But you don't need to know a thing about RNA to play.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/a5a16cbba78d6d4e65ec80e37a9c55a3.poster.avif?t=1793714733\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/a5a16cbba78d6d4e65ec80e37a9c55a3.webm?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/extras\/a5a16cbba78d6d4e65ec80e37a9c55a3.mp4?t=1793714733\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 levels. 10 chapters. Journey from folding your first hairpin to multi-strand gauntlets that fold your brain. Master every level to achieve the prismatic endgame.  <\/p>","short_description":"Aptamirror is a meditative physics-based puzzle game inspired by molecular biology. Manipulate RNA strands by grabbing, mutating, cleaving, and ligating to match increasingly complex target structures. Challenge yourself with 50 handcrafted puzzles designed by a PhD Biochemist. Think. Fold. Repeat.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/a72dad961cb4377c799e85c17b3539711c5f1dc7\/header.jpg?t=1793714733","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/936bc7776ee932867c3ab1830c9f5f5d0c9c87e5\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793714733","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/936bc7776ee932867c3ab1830c9f5f5d0c9c87e5\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793714733","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-1135G7 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 3200U or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel Iris Xe \/ NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ AMD Radeon RX 550 or better, with Vulkan support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> On integrated graphics and lower spec devices, turn on &quot;Performance Mode&quot; (Settings -&gt; Display). Requires a graphics driver with Vulkan support.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"© 2026 Stellar Genesis Games LLC. All rights reserved. Aptamirror and Stellar Genesis Games are trademarks of Stellar Genesis Games LLC.","developers":["Stellar Genesis Games"],"publishers":["Stellar Genesis Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":899,"final":719,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$8.99","final_formatted":"$7.19"},"packages":[1599437],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Aptamirror","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1599437,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Aptamirror - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$8.99<\/span> $7.19","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":719}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":15,"description":"Stats"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/da888c139750748cf423c79447b7d920c4fec483\/ss_da888c139750748cf423c79447b7d920c4fec483.600x338.jpg?t=1793714733","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4589160\/da888c139750748cf423c79447b7d920c4fec483\/ss_da888c139750748cf423c79447b7d920c4fec483.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793714733"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/s